      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790236411220,
      "created": 1790235977828,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Project - Book Store\n\nAdmin side\n\nAdd Book (Book form) - if it have Audio Book then upload audio-book field - name , no of page , … <-- This is Form 1 (fields required for all 3 forms ? optional ? )\n\nAuthor form  <-- Form 2  note- when on one of the forms the field name that of the 3 (book, author and publisher) must appear as a dropdown as they are already registered.\n\nPublisher form <-- Form 3\n\nAdvertisement area should be prepared (ad here means the what would be listed on the mobile ad section like \"stg % off books\" and its background image)\n\nReports - Sold books <-- what reports do they want ? Answer - how much books (recently , daily, ..) , Books that have audio books , Which books are being sold most and other similar reports\n",
      "fontSize": 39.55555555555554,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Project - Book Store\n\nAdmin side\n\nAdd Book (Book form) - if it have Audio Book then upload audio-book field - name , no of page , … <-- This is Form 1 (fields required for all 3 forms ? optional ? )\n\nAuthor form  <-- Form 2  note- when on one of the forms the field name that of the 3 (book, author and publisher) must appear as a dropdown as they are already registered.\n\nPublisher form <-- Form 3\n\nAdvertisement area should be prepared (ad here means the what would be listed on the mobile ad section like \"stg % off books\" and its background image)\n\nReports - Sold books <-- what reports do they want ? Answer - how much books (recently , daily, ..) , Books that have audio books , Which books are being sold most and other similar reports\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    }
  ],
